      <abstract>&#xA;&lt;p&gt;This talk will be an overview of the UC Engine open-source project. It will highlight the key features of the framework, what applications can be built with it, how the community will benefit from the open source project and what UC Engine could be in future years...&lt;/p&gt;      </abstract>
